 69	  /// spec-5-1 — the search surface's own 300ms skeleton threshold,
 70	  /// mirroring [_skeletonTimer]/[_showSkeleton] above but keyed off
 71	  /// `EntriesSearchCubit`'s `ResourceLoading` rather than
 72	  /// `MeusRegistrosLoading`: started fresh on every transition into
 73	  /// `ResourceLoading` (`_onSearchStateChanged` below), since unlike the
 74	  /// first-load timer above (started once, in [initState]) a search can
